@startuml kairos-manage-roles-and-permissions-sequence
title Manage Roles and Permissions

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open User Roles & Permissions page
WebAdmin -> API: GET /security/roles
API -> DB: SELECT roles + permissions
DB --> API: roles
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

Admin -> WebAdmin: Update permissions for role\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: PUT /security/roles/{roleId} {permissions}
API -> DB: UPDATE RolePermissions
DB --> API: OK
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

WebAdmin --> Admin: Show "Permissions updated"

@enduml
